  "prefLabel": "Lan 304.02 Application/Licensure Fees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lan 304.02 Application/Licensure Fees.\n\n(a) The application fee for licensure as a land surveyor shall be $120.00.\n\n(b) The fee for the professional land surveyors exam and each re-exam shall be $75.00.\n\n(c) The fee for the fundamentals of land surveying application and each re-application shall be $75.00.\n\n(d) Re-exam fees shall be the same as initial exam fee indicated in Lan 304.02(b), (c) and (g).\n\n(e) The fee for the application for a certificate of authorization shall be $50.00 for a proprietorship, $75.00 for a corporation or partnerships.\n\n(f) The fee for verification of licensure shall be $25.00.\n\n(g) The fee for the New Hampshire legal aspects exam shall be $125.00.\n\n(h) The fee for a temporary permit shall be $300.00.\n\nSource. #5934, eff 12-9-94; ss by #6929-B, 1-12-99; amd by #7549, eff 8-25-01; amd by #7950, eff 9-10-03; ss by #9340, eff 1-1-09; amd by #10440, eff 11-1-13; ss by #12031, eff 11-1-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lan100-500.html"
